 "name_en": "Manage Safety Data Sheets for Products (3VR)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Manage Safety Data Sheets for Products (3VR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio2b10f49348ad4f4fb2d8e35668ef478a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2b10f49348ad4f4fb2d8e35668ef478a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Placing chemical products on the market requires an efficient system support for handling mandatory documentation as defined by regulators. This scope item covers the main process steps for the maintenance of final safety data sheets as documents for products in the required languages for geographically defined jurisdictions.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">With this scope item, safety data sheets can be managed and linked to products using the general product compliance purpose concept. Applicable safety data sheet documents can be assigned to products and released. The compliance status of affected products can be tracked. Safety data sheets can be transmitted by the system to customers.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2b10f49348ad4f4fb2d8e35668ef478a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Flag products as relevant for compliance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine and assign markets to your products</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Derive relevant compliance purposes from the assigned markets for your products</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use dedicated compliance requirements to manage, version, and store safety data sheets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assess product requirements for safety data sheets in specific countries and language variants and maintain the status</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2b10f49348ad4f4fb2d8e35668ef478a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Mitigate compliance risks with up-to-date information integrated into the value chain</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Have product steward specialists get informed about new markets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate the safety data sheet requirements and management into the general product compliance management processes, providing an integrated view on the status</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate the safety data sheet processes of a product in business processes within the value chain</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>管理产品的安全技术说明书 (3VR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio2b10f49348ad4f4fb2d8e35668ef478a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2b10f49348ad4f4fb2d8e35668ef478a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">将化工产品推向市场需要高效的系统支持，以处理监管机构定义的强制性文档。此范围项目涵盖维护最终安全技术说明书的主要流程步骤，这些安全技术说明书作为地理定义管辖区所需语言的产品文档。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过此范围项目，可以使用常规产品合规性目的概念管理安全技术说明书并将其链接到产品。适用的安全技术说明书文档可以分配到产品并发布。可以跟踪受影响产品的合规性状态。系统可以将安全技术说明书传输给客户。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2b10f49348ad4f4fb2d8e35668ef478a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将产品标记为与合规性相关</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确定市场并将其分配到产品</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从为产品分配的市场派生相关合规性目的。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用专用合规性要求管理、版本化和存储安全技术说明书</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">评估特定国家/地区和语言变式的安全技术说明书的产品要求，并维护状态</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio2b10f49348ad4f4fb2d8e35668ef478a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过将最新信息集成到价值链中，降低合规性风险</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">让产品管理专家了解新市场</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将安全技术说明书要求和管理集成到常规产品合规性管理流程，提供有关状态的集成视图</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在价值链的业务流程中，集成产品的安全技术说明书流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
